    {
      "step_id": "S0017",
      "decision": "用只覆盖 “Capital Improvement Projects (”“Disaster Projects (”“Capital Improvement Projects and Disaster Recovery Projects (” 的章节正则遍历 19 份报告，未覆盖实际存在的 “Capital Improvement and Disaster Recovery Projects (Design/Construction/Completed)” 合并章节。",
      "reasoning": "E00041 与 E00045 显示 rid_0001 含 3 个 “Capital Improvement and Disaster Recovery Projects (...)” 合并章节，而 E00054 中 S0017 对 rid_0001 只报告 1 个章节（Line 491: Capital Improvement Projects (Not Started)），说明合并章节被漏检。若沿用该结果，合并章节下的项目会被遗漏或无法判定 capital/disaster，直接影响 R0002/R0003 的类型判定。",
      "should_have": "在章节正则中加入 “Capital Improvement and Disaster Recovery Projects (” 模式，并对合并章节内部按项目条目区分 capital 与 disaster，而不是仅依赖章节标题。",
